\fs28 \cf0 A Lightweight, Text-Focused Web Companion for X (Twitter)\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\fs24 \cf0 X-App-Lite
\f1\b0  is a free, lightweight web application designed to offer a simpler, cleaner way to interact with X (formerly Twitter).\
Built with HTML, CSS, and JavaScript, it focuses on text-based communication, fast loading, and minimal distractions.\
No installation, additional account registration, or X Developer API access is required.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa298\partightenfactor0

