\f0\b\fs36 \cf0 How It Works\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs24 \cf0 X-App-Lite works as a lightweight companion to the official X website.\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\ls2\ilvl0\cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	1	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Open the application in your web browser.\
\ls2\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	2	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Write a text post using the built-in composer.\
\ls2\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	3	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Select the publishing option to continue on X.\
\ls2\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	4	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Sign in to your X account if required.\
\ls2\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	5	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Review and publish your post.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\cf0 You can also access your timeline, search for public content, and open your favorite profiles.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f0\b \cf0 Important:
\f1\b0  X-App-Lite does not independently retrieve or display X timelines. Reading posts, viewing profiles, and publishing content take place through the official X website, where media and other standard X features may still appear.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa298\partightenfactor0

